==Overview==
==={{ALttP|-}}===
{{Stub|ALttP}}

==={{LA|-}}===
If Link attempts to enter [[Deep Water]] without first having obtained the [[Flippers]], he will sink to the bottom and drown, before coming back on land and taking damage.{{How Many|LA}} After obtaining them, he will be able to Swim and [[Dive]] underwater.<ref name="LADX Instruction Booklet 21"/> By using his Swimming and Diving ability combined, Link can find some treasures like [[Piece of Heart|Pieces of Heart]].<ref name="LADX Prima 108"/> Link can also swim underwater for a short period of time to avoid being hit by Enemies.<ref name="LADX Prima 54"/> Additionally, some places can only be accessed by Link through the use of Swimming and Diving, for example the [[Catfish's Maw]],<ref name="LADX Prima 59"/> or the spot under the bridge where the [[Fisherman]] is [[Fishing]], making Swimming and the Flippers necessary in order to complete the [[Trading Quest]].<ref name="LADX Prima 112"/>

Despite learning how to Swim, Link is unable to escape from [[Koholint Island]] simply by Swimming.

==={{OoT|-}}===
{{Stub|OoT}}

==={{MM|-}}===
{{Stub|MM}}
While wearing the [[Zora Mask]], [[Zora Link]] can glide through Water at high speeds and [[Dolphin Jump]] to leap out of it.

