==={{SS|-}}===
{{Stub|SS}}
Link can Swim from the start of his quest but initially cannot go underwater. After he obtains the [[Water Dragon's Scale]], he becomes able to Dive below the surface as well as perform a spinning attack that can destroy obstacles.

==={{ALBW|-}}===
