==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Stub|BotW}}
Link can Swim as soon as he exits the [[Shrine of Resurrection]]. Unlike in {{SS|-}}, Swimming consumes [[Stamina]]. He is also not able to go underwater. When Link [[Targeting|Targets]] an [[Enemy]] while Swimming, his animation will change to the sidestroke he uses in {{OoT|-}}, {{TP|-}}, and {{SS|-}}.

